{
    "title": "Get in Touch",
    "content": "<h2>Contact Our Exhibition Stand Team</h2><p class=\"lead\">Let's discuss your next exhibition stand project.</p>\n<div class=\"row g-5 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-geo-alt\"></i></div><div><h5>Address</h5><p>Trump Towers No:12 - 405 M.köy Yolu Cd.<br>34358 Şişli İstanbul — Turkey</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-telephone\"></i></div><div><h5>Phone</h5><p>(+90) 212 876 7001</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope\"></i></div><div><h5>Email</h5><p>info@mtmessestand.com</p></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n<form class=\"contact-form\" name=\"contact\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify>\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" required></div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" required></div>\n<div class=\"col-12\"><textarea class=\"form-control\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your project...\"></textarea></div>\n<div class=\"col-12\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Send Message</button></div>\n</div></form></div></div>",
